      "html": "<div style=\"position:relative;\">\n    <div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:34px;padding:34px 40px;margin-top:24px;\"><div style=\"font-size:52px;font-weight:900;color:#03402F;text-align:center;margin-bottom:24px;\">Förklaring</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:38px;font-weight:800;color:#0A0A0A;text-align:center;margin-bottom:6px;\">Prisma</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:27px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(10,10,10,0.55);text-align:center;line-height:1.35;margin-bottom:22px;\">Varje yta i nätet har samma färg som sin plats på figuren.</div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:18px;margin-bottom:18px;\">\n      \n    <div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:#F4F4F1;border-radius:24px;padding:14px 10px 12px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:rgba(10,10,10,0.55);\">Figur</div>\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 250\" width=\"360\" height=\"250\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"display:block;\"><path d=\"M 232.5 72.1 L 127.5 9.5 L 50.8 177.9 L 155.8 240.5 Z\" fill=\"rgb(194,160,220)\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M 155.8 240.5 L 309.2 197.7 L 232.5 72.1 Z\" fill=\"rgb(237,146,140)\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n    </div>\n      \n    <div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:#F4F4F1;border-radius:24px;padding:14px 10px 12px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:rgba(10,10,10,0.55);\">Från andra sidan</div>\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 250\" width=\"360\" height=\"250\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"display:block;\"><path d=\"M 50.8 197.7 L 155.8 135.1 L 232.5 9.5 L 127.5 72.1 Z\" fill=\"rgb(247,219,162)\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M 204.2 240.5 L 309.2 177.9 L 155.8 135.1 L 50.8 197.7 Z\" fill=\"rgb(192,224,183)\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M 232.5 9.5 L 155.8 135.1 L 309.2 177.9 Z\" fill=\"rgb(174,202,235)\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n      \n    <div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:#F4F4F1;border-radius:24px;padding:14px 10px 12px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:rgba(10,10,10,0.55);\">Nät</div>\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 200 160\" width=\"560\" height=\"448\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"display:block;\">\n    <path d=\"M 107.7 111.6 L 128.7 75.1 L 149.8 111.6 Z\" fill=\"rgb(232,115,107)\" stroke=\"rgb(232,115,107)\" stroke-width=\"0.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M 50.2 54.1 L 92.3 54.1 L 71.3 90.5 Z\" fill=\"rgb(107,158,219)\" stroke=\"rgb(107,158,219)\" stroke-width=\"0.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M 107.7 111.6 L 71.3 90.5 L 92.3 54.1 L 128.7 75.1 Z\" fill=\"rgb(140,199,125)\" stroke=\"rgb(140,199,125)\" stroke-width=\"0.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M 92.3 12.0 L 92.3 54.1 L 50.2 54.1 L 50.2 12.0 Z\" fill=\"rgb(242,196,105)\" stroke=\"rgb(242,196,105)\" stroke-width=\"0.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M 86.7 148.0 L 50.2 127.0 L 71.3 90.5 L 107.7 111.6 Z\" fill=\"rgb(184,143,214)\" stroke=\"rgb(184,143,214)\" stroke-width=\"0.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n    <g stroke=\"#0A0A0A\" stroke-width=\"1.14\" stroke-dasharray=\"3.57 2.50\" stroke-opacity=\"0.85\"><line x1=\"107.7\" y1=\"111.6\" x2=\"128.7\" y2=\"75.1\"/><line x1=\"92.3\" y1=\"54.1\" x2=\"50.2\" y2=\"54.1\"/><line x1=\"71.3\" y1=\"90.5\" x2=\"92.3\" y2=\"54.1\"/><line x1=\"107.7\" y1=\"111.6\" x2=\"71.3\" y2=\"90.5\"/></g>\n    <g stroke=\"#0A0A0A\" stroke-width=\"1.79\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M 107.7 111.6 L 86.7 148.0 L 50.2 127.0 L 71.3 90.5 L 50.2 54.1 L 50.2 12.0 L 92.3 12.0 L 92.3 54.1 L 128.7 75.1 L 149.8 111.6 Z\"/></g>\n  </svg>\n    </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:500;color:#0A0A0A;line-height:1.42;margin-top:24px;\">Prismat har två triangelgavlar och tre kvadratiska sidor. Trianglarna kan sitta på flera ställen i nätet, men de måste hamna i var sin ände när sidorna rullas ihop till ett bälte.</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:32px;font-weight:800;color:#056B50;text-align:center;margin-top:20px;\">Rätt svar: C</div>\n    </div></div>",
